          "title": "Scene data format confirmed (scene.json)",
          "rationale": "JSON with id, name, stage dimensions, and layers array. Layer types: media, effect, glyph-group, component. Groups use children array for sub-layers with interleaving support. Z-order is array position (last on top). Both editor and agent operate on this format.",
